1
00:00:57,719 --> 00:00:59,039
Come, let's have a drink.

2
00:00:59,079 --> 00:00:59,679
Come.

3
00:00:59,679 --> 00:01:00,079
Cheers!

4
00:01:05,560 --> 00:01:08,480
You were all invited by Young Master Li.

5
00:01:11,079 --> 00:01:12,400
Have a seat, Groom.

6
00:01:13,280 --> 00:01:15,599
It hasn't been this lively here in a long time.

7
00:01:15,599 --> 00:01:16,879
You must be starving.

8
00:01:16,879 --> 00:01:17,680
Here.

9
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:20,560
Eat something first to line your stomach.

10
00:01:25,439 --> 00:01:26,560
Here.

11
00:01:26,560 --> 00:01:27,680
Drink up!

12
00:01:45,599 --> 00:01:46,359
Here.

13
00:01:49,680 --> 00:01:50,480
Have another glass.

14
00:01:50,480 --> 00:01:51,280
Jiushuang.

15
00:01:53,359 --> 00:01:54,159
Jiushuang.

16
00:01:54,799 --> 00:01:57,120
Do you know how much effort it took to find this place?

17
00:01:57,120 --> 00:01:58,599
Just to save you.

18
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:00,879
Jiushuang, let's go.

19
00:02:04,799 --> 00:02:05,599
Jiushuang.

20
00:02:06,640 --> 00:02:07,840
Why aren't you saying anything?

21
00:02:11,919 --> 00:02:12,439
A ghost!

22
00:02:12,439 --> 00:02:13,319
It's a ghost!

23
00:02:16,719 --> 00:02:18,120
Chun'er!

24
00:02:20,840 --> 00:02:22,800
The bride has arrived!

25
00:02:24,280 --> 00:02:25,280
Mother!

26
00:02:26,120 --> 00:02:27,439
Tiankun.

27
00:02:27,439 --> 00:02:28,240
Let's go.

28
00:02:30,120 --> 00:02:32,680
The Honored Parents have arrived!

29
00:02:38,919 --> 00:02:39,719
Continue.

30
00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:41,879
Come on, fill 'em up!

31
00:02:42,039 --> 00:02:43,280
Distinguished guests,

32
00:02:43,400 --> 00:02:46,159
I declare the wedding officially begun!

33
00:02:46,159 --> 00:02:48,759
The wedding officially begins!

34
00:02:48,759 --> 00:02:51,319
First bow to Heaven and Earth!

35
00:02:51,879 --> 00:02:53,960
Tastes pretty good.

36
00:02:53,960 --> 00:02:56,479
Here, try this, it's good.

37
00:02:57,479 --> 00:02:59,159
Come on, cheers!

38
00:03:03,319 --> 00:03:04,680
Tell them to keep it down.

39
00:03:04,759 --> 00:03:06,199
The guests Young Master Li invited...

40
00:03:06,199 --> 00:03:07,560
why are they so rude?

41
00:03:08,639 --> 00:03:09,599
Master,

42
00:03:09,599 --> 00:03:11,560
Young Master Li didn't invite anyone.

43
00:03:13,639 --> 00:03:15,000
Then who sent them?

44
00:03:15,560 --> 00:03:16,879
Here.

45
00:03:16,879 --> 00:03:17,719
Cheers!

46
00:03:17,719 --> 00:03:18,680
Drink some more.

47
00:03:20,319 --> 00:03:21,680
Who are you people?

48
00:03:21,680 --> 00:03:23,479
How dare you crash the Qi Family's wedding!

49
00:03:32,719 --> 00:03:33,520
Master,

50
00:03:40,840 --> 00:03:42,919
It must just be an illusion.

51
00:03:43,199 --> 00:03:45,000
As a Feng Shui Family,

52
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:46,159
we're not afraid of this.

53
00:03:46,719 --> 00:03:47,919
Let the ceremony continue.

54
00:03:47,919 --> 00:03:48,800
Quick!

55
00:03:49,080 --> 00:03:50,879
Second bow to the parents!

56
00:03:56,759 --> 00:03:58,520
Why did my father turn into a zombie?

57
00:03:59,560 --> 00:04:00,919
Young Master Li, what's wrong?

58
00:04:01,360 --> 00:04:02,080
Qi Tiankun.

59
00:04:02,080 --> 00:04:03,280
There's something weird about this secret room.

60
00:04:03,319 --> 00:04:05,199
Grab the Talisman Book and leave quickly.

61
00:04:06,639 --> 00:04:09,639
The Talisman Book should be in the coffin.

62
00:04:30,920 --> 00:04:31,720
Mother!

63
00:04:36,319 --> 00:04:37,360
Where's my mother?

64
00:04:38,720 --> 00:04:40,920
Is the Talisman Book in the coffin?

65
00:04:42,439 --> 00:04:43,240
Go, quickly!

66
00:04:43,560 --> 00:04:44,680
Go on!

67
00:04:44,680 --> 00:04:45,480
Go!

68
00:04:47,040 --> 00:04:48,120
Save me!

69
00:04:48,920 --> 00:04:50,279
Save me, Tiankun!

70
00:04:52,079 --> 00:04:53,560
Save me!

71
00:04:53,560 --> 00:04:54,160
Mother!

72
00:04:57,319 --> 00:04:58,160
Mother!

73
00:04:58,160 --> 00:04:58,800
Save me!

74
00:04:58,800 --> 00:04:59,600
Mother!

75
00:04:59,800 --> 00:05:00,399
Tiankun!

76
00:05:02,040 --> 00:05:03,279
Quick, help me!

77
00:05:20,279 --> 00:05:21,079
Mother!

78
00:05:23,480 --> 00:05:24,279
Mother!

79
00:05:24,959 --> 00:05:26,639
I'll strangle you!

80
00:05:26,759 --> 00:05:29,199
Qi Tiankun, I'll strangle you!

81
00:05:29,199 --> 00:05:30,439
Give me back my leg!

82
00:05:30,439 --> 00:05:31,959
I'll strangle you!

83
00:05:31,959 --> 00:05:33,600
Give me back my leg!

84
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:35,160
I'll strangle you!

85
00:05:35,240 --> 00:05:37,000
I'll kill you!

86
00:05:37,040 --> 00:05:38,920
I'll kill you!

87
00:05:39,240 --> 00:05:40,560
Qi Tiankun!

88
00:05:47,000 --> 00:05:47,680
Go!

89
00:05:59,360 --> 00:06:01,439
Go on, keep acting.

90
00:06:12,839 --> 00:06:14,319
Li Xiao!

91
00:06:14,319 --> 00:06:15,560
You're looking for this, right?

92
00:06:15,920 --> 00:06:18,079
The Qi Family's Talisman Book.

93
00:06:18,079 --> 00:06:19,439
So you have it.

94
00:06:20,480 --> 00:06:22,000
Give me the Talisman Book.

95
00:06:24,360 --> 00:06:25,279
Chun'er!

96
00:06:25,279 --> 00:06:27,120
How did you let this kid fool you?

97
00:06:27,399 --> 00:06:28,199
Come here, quickly.

98
00:06:32,680 --> 00:06:33,839
Chun'er.

99
00:06:34,079 --> 00:06:38,240
I am truly devoted to you and the Wan family.

100
00:06:38,560 --> 00:06:42,040
This foolish Mei woman means nothing to me.

101
00:06:42,639 --> 00:06:44,639
As long as we're together,

102
00:06:44,639 --> 00:06:48,199
I can gather the Talisman, Curse, Seal, and Eye.

103
00:06:48,639 --> 00:06:49,560
When that happens,

104
00:06:49,800 --> 00:06:51,680
I can lead everyone

105
00:06:51,920 --> 00:06:54,560
to break the curse on your four clans.

106
00:06:58,879 --> 00:07:00,360
How touching.

107
00:07:02,959 --> 00:07:04,639
Zhang Tianyou.

108
00:07:04,639 --> 00:07:06,519
I know you have the Hard Armor on you.

109
00:07:07,800 --> 00:07:09,920
But they don't, do they?

110
00:07:10,199 --> 00:07:12,199
Bring me the Talisman Book right now!

111
00:07:12,839 --> 00:07:14,480
Otherwise,

112
00:07:14,480 --> 00:07:16,680
don't blame me if I kill them all.

113
00:07:16,680 --> 00:07:17,800
Li Xiao,

114
00:07:17,800 --> 00:07:20,879
do you really think that with all these things,

115
00:07:20,879 --> 00:07:23,800
you can find the Tidal Tomb from twenty years ago?

116
00:07:24,240 --> 00:07:25,800
You'll never find it without the Dragon-Seeking Formula!

117
00:07:27,680 --> 00:07:29,399
What the hell do you know?

118
00:07:29,600 --> 00:07:31,120
I found out a long time ago.

119
00:07:31,120 --> 00:07:34,519
The Zhang family didn't all die off twenty years ago.

120
00:07:34,519 --> 00:07:36,560
There's still a descendant left.

121
00:07:37,480 --> 00:07:39,959
Did you find him?

122
00:07:41,160 --> 00:07:43,480
Once I become Head of the Four Clans,

123
00:07:43,480 --> 00:07:45,160
I'll find him soon enough.

124
00:07:45,639 --> 00:07:49,240
Once I use the Dragon-Seeking Formula to find that tomb,

125
00:07:49,279 --> 00:07:52,639
all the golden treasures inside will be mine.

126
00:07:53,639 --> 00:07:58,319
As for whether I'll seal that thing up while I'm at it,

127
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:04,480
that depends on how Wan-Mei-Qi-Sheng begs on their knees.

128
00:08:05,199 --> 00:08:06,959
There are no treasures there!

129
00:08:07,279 --> 00:08:07,879
It's a lie!

130
00:08:07,920 --> 00:08:09,519
Don't test my patience!

131
00:08:09,639 --> 00:08:11,160
Give me the Talisman Book!

132
00:08:11,319 --> 00:08:13,120
Or I'll kill them right now.

133
00:08:13,800 --> 00:08:14,720
Hurry!

134
00:08:24,480 --> 00:08:27,480
Qi Tianting, you bastard!

135
00:08:27,920 --> 00:08:29,399
You killed my Mother!

136
00:08:29,959 --> 00:08:31,800
I'll make you wish you were dead!

137
00:08:32,159 --> 00:08:32,799
Cousin!

138
00:08:32,799 --> 00:08:34,440
Sit here and don't move.

139
00:08:34,919 --> 00:08:37,240
Watch how I deal with that piece of trash.

140
00:08:39,679 --> 00:08:40,639
Hurry!

141
00:08:45,240 --> 00:08:46,039
Brother Tianyou!

142
00:08:47,240 --> 00:08:48,240
Brother Tianyou!

143
00:09:05,200 --> 00:09:07,279
Should've done this from the start.

144
00:09:08,120 --> 00:09:09,360
Qi Tiankun!

145
00:09:09,919 --> 00:09:12,120
Qi Tiankun, you bastard!

146
00:09:12,120 --> 00:09:13,399
Get the hell out here!

147
00:09:13,480 --> 00:09:15,039
Qi Tiankun!

148
00:09:15,039 --> 00:09:16,240
Get the hell out!

149
00:09:30,679 --> 00:09:32,399
You want to kill me?

150
00:09:32,519 --> 00:09:33,879
You want to kill me?

151
00:09:34,559 --> 00:09:35,759
You killed my Mother.

152
00:09:36,200 --> 00:09:38,519
I won't let you die so easily.

153
00:09:41,960 --> 00:09:42,759
Brother.

154
00:09:43,080 --> 00:09:46,159
You're even more useless than that Sheng family trash now.

155
00:09:48,240 --> 00:09:50,240
I'm going to make you watch

156
00:09:50,799 --> 00:09:53,399
how I toy with your women.

157
00:09:53,960 --> 00:09:54,919
Bastard!

158
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:00,960
Take this!

159
00:10:02,039 --> 00:10:03,519
Zhang Tianyou!

160
00:10:03,519 --> 00:10:05,039
After I kill you,

161
00:10:05,039 --> 00:10:07,200
I'll gouge out your eyes

162
00:10:07,200 --> 00:10:08,840
and make you watch

163
00:10:08,960 --> 00:10:13,399
how I take care of these three women for you.

164
00:10:15,559 --> 00:10:16,360
Li Xiao,

165
00:10:17,120 --> 00:10:19,039
take a good look at what's in your hand.

166
00:10:25,320 --> 00:10:26,200
Don't move!

167
00:10:28,240 --> 00:10:29,480
How is this possible?

168
00:10:30,600 --> 00:10:32,519
What kind of illusion did you use?

169
00:10:33,159 --> 00:10:35,039
That skeleton I saw earlier...

170
00:10:35,039 --> 00:10:36,159
You set that up too, right?

171
00:10:36,159 --> 00:10:37,360
Just figured it out?

172
00:10:37,879 --> 00:10:39,320
I won't bother explaining

173
00:10:39,320 --> 00:10:41,639
how the magnetic field and corpse miasma here

174
00:10:41,639 --> 00:10:43,399
messed with your senses,

175
00:10:43,559 --> 00:10:45,360
because your life isn't in my hands right now.

176
00:10:45,360 --> 00:10:46,559
Sister Mei,

177
00:10:46,559 --> 00:10:47,840
he lied to you before

178
00:10:48,159 --> 00:10:49,240
and tried to kill you.

179
00:10:50,679 --> 00:10:51,600
You should kill him.

180
00:10:52,360 --> 00:10:53,679
Kill him?

181
00:10:54,440 --> 00:10:55,879
I'm afraid of dirtying my hands.

182
00:10:57,279 --> 00:10:58,200
I don't mind getting my hands dirty.

183
00:10:59,320 --> 00:11:00,200
I'll kill him.

184
00:11:11,399 --> 00:11:12,320
I'm fine.

185
00:11:12,320 --> 00:11:13,039
Young Master.

186
00:11:13,519 --> 00:11:14,320
We're here.

187
00:11:15,120 --> 00:11:16,320
Perfect timing.

188
00:11:22,480 --> 00:11:23,840
Zhang Tianyou!

189
00:11:23,840 --> 00:11:26,279
Now even heaven is on my side.

190
00:11:26,440 --> 00:11:28,440
How can you possibly fight me?
